    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>A Maze-Like Cinema</strong><br>The layout of the theater changes every time. It may look familiar, but something always feels different.<br>You\u2019re not losing your way\u2014someone might be changing the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles and Hidden Clues</strong><br>Posters, seat arrangements, even the sound of speakers can all be part of a puzzle.<br>Sharpen your observation and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Immersive Sound Design and Atmosphere</strong><br>Uneasy silence, the distant whir of a projector, and echoes in an empty auditorium\u2014<br>everything comes together to create a tense and immersive journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>A Maze-Like Cinema</strong><br>The layout of the theater changes every time. It may look familiar, but something always feels different.<br>You\u2019re not losing your way\u2014someone might be changing the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles and Hidden Clues</strong><br>Posters, seat arrangements, even the sound of speakers can all be part of a puzzle.<br>Sharpen your observation and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Immersive Sound Design and Atmosphere</strong><br>Uneasy silence, the distant whir of a projector, and echoes in an empty auditorium\u2014<br>everything comes together to create a tense and immersive journey.</p>",
    "short_description": "A twisted cinema where familiar halls shift each time. Someone may be changing the path. Clues hide in posters, seats, and sounds. Watch closely. Silence, echoes, and the projector\u2019s hum create a tense atmosphere that pulls you in\u2014and keeps you on edge.",
